      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WITH DISCRETION (2) didn't have the best of luck last start at this track and trip, missing by 1.7L as the odds-on favourite. His win two back was superb however and he's racing in top order with Pike sticking. Can stay out of trouble this time and get back to winning ways. SWEET SURRENDER (6) is knocking on the door of another win, missing by 0.4L here last week in an easier race. Her figures stack up to a race of this calibre though and she'll carry less weight today. Can make her presence felt once again. ROMMEO (4) got back to winning ways here a couple of weeks ago when scoring in a photo finish. Drawn better this time with O'Donnell hopping on board and he can be in the finish once again. SISU SPIRIT (5) is racing well and steps out to this trip for the first time. Fiore sticks and he creates plenty of interest. CHOLLIMA (3) was better last time and won't be far away.",
